{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [],
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Workshop dashboard",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Traffic",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Requests per second by route.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Request Rate by Route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Error rate (5xx) per route.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "id": 3,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}} 5xx"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Error Rate by Route (5xx)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Latency",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "p50/p95/p99 latency per route.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (http_route, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{http_route}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (http_route, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{http_route}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (http_route, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Latency Percentiles by Route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Runtime — Goroutines & Memory",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Total goroutine count.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "id": 7,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "go_goroutine_count",
          "legendFormat": "goroutines"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Goroutine Count",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Heap memory in use.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 19 },
      "id": 8,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "process_heap_inuse_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "heap in use"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Heap Memory In Use",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Query Reference — Logs & Traces",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Logs — Loki\n\n[Open in Explore →](/explore?schemaVersion=1&panes=%7B%22loki-logs%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22loki%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22expr%22%3A%22%7Bservice_name%3D%5C%22incident-response-api%5C%22%7D%20%7C%20operation%3D%60catalog.search%60%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22loki%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22loki%22%7D%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22now-30m%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22now%22%7D%7D%7D&orgId=1)\n\nPreloaded LogQL query — structured logs for `catalog.search`:\n```\n{service_name=\"incident-response-api\"} | operation=`catalog.search`\n```"
      },
      "title": "Query Logs",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 28 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Traces — Tempo\n\n[Open in Explore →](/explore?schemaVersion=1&panes=%7B%22tempo-traces%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%7B%20resource.service.name%20%3D%20%5C%22incident-response-api%5C%22%20%7D%22%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22%7D%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22now-30m%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22now%22%7D%7D%7D&orgId=1)\n\nPreloaded TraceQL query — all traces for the API service:\n```\n{ resource.service.name = \"incident-response-api\" }\n```"
      },
      "title": "Query Traces",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["workshop", "incident-response"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
